### Add a new product
POST http://localhost:8080/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigoSku": "SKU123",
  "nombre": "Martillo",
  "descripcion": "Martillo de acero forjado",
  "precioCompra": 25.50,
  "stockInicial": 100,
  "stockMinimo": 20,
  "categoria": "Herramientas",
  "rucProveedor": "20481234567"
}

### Add stock to existing product
POST http://localhost:8080/productos/stock?cantidad=50&codigoSku=SKU123

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/productos

### Get products with low stock
GET http://localhost:8080/productos/bajoStock
